          "sha256": "532824872fd477dcb38266f0d9a9e093fa54562301a66e747b266c7bcee23046",
          "script": "Christ, give us humility and surrender to God.\n\nPray the Glory Be, and the Fatima prayer if desired.\nThen move to the next mystery.",
